# Recall Study Generator

[![CI](https://github.com/dsugurtuna/recall-study-generator/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/dsugurtuna/recall-study-generator/actions/workflows/ci.yml)

**Automated clinical recall cohort design with genotype stratification, eligibility filtering, and protocol generation.**

Designs balanced recall-by-genotype studies by selecting eligible biobank participants into genotype groups, applying multi-stage exclusion criteria, and generating structured study protocols with participant lists.

> **Portfolio project.** Demonstrates generalised recall study design workflows. No real participant data is included.

---

## Architecture

```
src/recall_gen/
    __init__.py       # Public API exports
    designer.py       # Genotype-stratified cohort design (StudyDesigner)
    eligibility.py    # Multi-stage exclusion filtering (EligibilityFilter)
    protocol.py       # Protocol and participant list generation
tests/
    test_designer.py  # Design and eligibility tests
    test_protocol.py  # Protocol export tests
```

---

## Quick start

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest -v
```

### Python API

```python
from recall_gen import StudyDesigner, EligibilityFilter, ProtocolGenerator
from recall_gen.designer import ParticipantRecord

# Define participants
participants = [
    ParticipantRecord("P001", "e3/e3", age=45, sex="M"),
    ParticipantRecord("P002", "e3/e4", age=55, sex="F"),
    ParticipantRecord("P003", "e4/e4", age=50, sex="M"),
]

# Eligibility filtering
filt = EligibilityFilter()
filt.add_stage("under_18", lambda p: p.age < 18)
filt.add_stage("withdrawn", lambda p: p.consent_status == "withdrawn")
result = filt.apply(participants)

# Study design
designer = StudyDesigner(target_per_group=50, min_age=18, max_age=80)
design = designer.design(participants, "APOE Recall")

# Protocol export
gen = ProtocolGenerator()
protocol = gen.generate(design)
ProtocolGenerator.export_participant_list(design, "recall_participants.csv")
ProtocolGenerator.export_protocol_json(protocol, "protocol.json")
```

---

## Key features

| Feature | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Genotype stratification** | Balanced group allocation with configurable target per group |
| **Age/sex balancing** | Priority sorting by age for balanced demographic spread |
| **Consent checking** | Filters withdrawn participants automatically |
| **Multi-stage exclusion** | Composable eligibility pipeline with per-stage counts |
| **Protocol generation** | Structured protocol with customisable template sections |
| **CSV/JSON export** | Participant lists and protocol documents |

## Development

```bash
make dev        # install with dev dependencies
make test       # run pytest
make lint       # run ruff
